    summary """
        Opt-P Contract A: modular multi-section and VarDCT multi-group encodes are byte-identical at 1 vs 4 section workers (EncodeResources::groups). ordered_map reduces in fixed index order via std::thread::scope; no Rayon dependency.
        """
}

